g qoʻshimchalari','Address Line %d'=>'Manzil qatori %d','Affiliate'=>'Hamkor','Due to violation of our affiliation terms, we decided to temporarily block your affiliation account. If you have any questions, please contact support.'=>'Hamkorlik shartlarimiz buzilganligi sababli, biz hamkorlik hisobingizni vaqtincha bloklashga qaror qildik. Agar savollaringiz boʻlsa, qoʻllab-quvvatlash xizmati bilan bogʻlaning.','Your affiliation account was temporarily suspended.'=>'Sizning hamkorlik hisobingiz vaqtincha toʻxtatildi.','Your affiliate application for %1$s has been accepted! Log in to your affiliate area at: %2$s.'=>'%1$s uchun hamkorlik arizangiz qabul qilindi! Hamkorlik hududingizga kiring: %2$s.','Thank you for applying for our affiliate program, unfortunately, we\'ve decided at this point to reject your application. Please try again in 30 days.'=>'Hamkorlik dasturimizga ariza topshirganingiz uchun tashakkur, afsuski, ayni paytda arizangizni rad etishga qaror qildik. Iltimos, 30 kundan keyin qayta urinib koʻring.','Thank you for applying for our affiliate program, we\'ll review your details during the next 14 days and will get back to you with further information.'=>'Hamkorlik dasturimizga ariza topshirganingiz uchun tashakkur, maʼlumotlaringizni kelgusi 14 kun ichida koʻrib chiqamiz va qoʻshimcha maʼlumot bilan sizga javob qaytaramiz.','%s tracking cookie after the first visit to maximize earnings potential.'=>'Daromad imkoniyatini oshirish uchun birinchi tashrifdan keyin %s kuzatuv kukisi.','Affiliation'=>'Mansublik','Once your license expires you can still use the Free version but you will NOT have access to the %s features.'=>'Litsenziyangiz muddati tugagach, siz hali ham Bepul versiyadan foydalanishingiz mumkin, ammo sizda %s xususiyatlariga kirish imkoni BOʻLMAYDI.','Once your license expires you will no longer be able to use the %s, unless you activate it again with a valid premium license.'=>'Litsenziyangiz muddati tugagach, uni yaroqli premium litsenziya bilan qayta faollashtirmaguningizcha, %s dan foydalana olmaysiz.','You can still enjoy all %1$s features but you will not have access to %2$s security & feature updates, nor support.'=>'Siz hali ham %1$s ning barcha imkoniyatlaridan foydalanishingiz mumkin, biroq sizda %2$s xavfsizlik va funksiya yangilanishlariga, shuningdek, qo‘llab-quvvatlash xizmatiga kirish imkoni bo‘lmaydi.','Thanks for upgrading.'=>'Yangilaganingiz uchun tashakkur.','After your free %1$s, pay as little as %2$s'=>'Bepul %1$s muddatingizdan so‘ng, kamida %2$s to‘lang','Agree & Activate License'=>'Rozilik bildirish va litsenziyani faollashtirish','I Agree - Change User'=>'Roziman - Foydalanuvchini oʻzgartirish','All Requests'=>'Barcha soʻrovlar','All Types'=>'Barcha turlar','allow'=>'Ruxsat berish','You\'ve already opted-in to our usage-tracking, which helps us keep improving the %s.'=>'Siz allaqachon foydalanishni kuzatishimizga rozilik bergansiz, bu esa bizga %s yaxshilashda davom etishga yordam beradi.','You\'ve already opted-in to our usage-tracking, which helps us keep improving them.'=>'Siz ularni doimiy yaxshilab borishimizga yordam beradigan foydalanish kuzatuvimizga allaqachon rozilik bildirgansiz.','Amount'=>'Miqdor','as once a yearAnnual'=>'Yillik','as once a yearAnnually'=>'Yillik','Anonymous feedback'=>'Anonim fikr-mulohaza','as application program interfaceAPI'=>'API','Apply on all sites in the network.'=>'Tarmoqdagi barcha saytlarga qoʻllash.','Apply on all pending sites.'=>'Kutilayotgan barcha saytlarga qoʻllang.','Apply to become an affiliate'=>'Hamkor boʻlish uchun ariza topshiring','Approve & Start Trial'=>'Tasdiqlang va sinov muddatini boshlang','Kindly tell us the reason so we can improve.'=>'Yaxshilashimiz uchun iltimos, sababini bizga bildiring.','Enter the email address you\'ve used for the upgrade below and we will resend you the license key.'=>'Yangilash uchun foydalangan elektron pochta manzilingizni quyida kiriting va biz sizga litsenziya kalitini qayta yuboramiz.','