r','verbUpdate'=>'Yangilash','Would you like to proceed with the update?'=>'Yangilashni davom ettirishni xohlaysizmi?','Update'=>'Yangilash','Update License'=>'Litsenziyani yangilash','Upgrade'=>'Yangilash','Important Upgrade Notice:'=>'Muhim yangilanish bildirishnomasi:','Upload and activate the downloaded version'=>'Yuklab olingan versiyani yuklang va faollashtiring','User Dashboard'=>'Foydalanuvchi boshqaruv paneli','Sorry, we could not complete the email update. Another user with the same email is already registered.'=>'Kechirasiz, e-pochta yangilanishini yakunlay olmadik. Xuddi shu e-pochtaga ega boshqa foydalanuvchi allaqachon roʻyxatdan oʻtgan.','If you would like to give up the ownership of the %1$s\'s account to %2$s click the Change Ownership button.'=>'Agar %1$s hisobining egaligini %2$s foydalanuvchisiga topshirmoqchi boʻlsangiz, Egalikni oʻzgartirish tugmasini bosing.','User ID'=>'Foydalanuvchi identifikatori','User key'=>'Foydalanuvchi kaliti','Users'=>'Foydalanuvchilar','Value'=>'Qiymat','Verification mail was just sent to %s. If you can\'t find it after 5 min, please check your spam box.'=>'Tasdiqlash xati hozirgina %s manziliga yuborildi. Agar 5 daqiqadan so‘ng uni topa olmasangiz, iltimos, spam qutingizni tekshiring.','Verified'=>'Tasdiqlangan','Verify Email'=>'E-pochtani tasdiqlang','product versionVersion'=>'Versiya','Version %s was released.'=>'%s versiyasi chiqarildi.','View details'=>'Tafsilotlarni ko‘rish','Click to view full-size screenshot %d'=>'To‘liq o‘lchamdagi %d-skrinshotni ko‘rish uchun bosing','View paid features'=>'Pullik xususiyatlarni koʻrish','Warning'=>'Ogohlantirish','What is your %s?'=>'Sizning %s qanday?','Used to express elation, enthusiasm, or triumph (especially in electronic communication).W00t'=>'Ura','WordPress.org Plugin Page'=>'WordPress.org plagin sahifasi','It seems like one of the authentication parameters is wrong. Update your Public Key, Secret Key & User ID, and try again.'=>'Autentifikatsiya parametrlaridan 